read<br />1 roasted pepper<br />1 small zucchini<br />4 tbsp hummus<br />A handful of rocket\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--mut)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: 'var(--fs-md)', lineHeight: '20px' }}>\n            Check the ingredients for allergens. Adjust quantities before you start.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--panel2)', borderColor: 'var(--line)', borderRadius: 'var(--r-lg)', borderStyle: 'solid', borderWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexBasis: '0%', flexDirection: 'column', flexGrow: '1', gap: 'var(--space-24)', padding: 'var(--space-32)' }}>\n          <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>\n            <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--fg)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: 'var(--fs-xl)', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: '24px' }}>\n              Build your sandwich\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--mut)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: 'var(--fs-md)', lineHeight: '18px' }}>\n              Written steps\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--fg)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: 'var(--fs-lg)', lineHeight: '32px', whiteSpace: 'pre', width: 'max-content' }}>\n            01{'  '}Toast the bread until lightly golden.<br />02{'  '}Spread hummus across each slice.<br />03{'  '}Layer the vegetables and rocket.<br />04{'  '}Close, slice, and serve warm.\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: 'var(--space-16)' }}>\n            <div style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--acc)', borderRadius: 'var(--r-sm)', boxSizing: 'border-box', paddingBlock: 'var(--space-12)', paddingInline: 'var(--space-16)' }}>\n              <div style={{ boxSizing: 'b